### StoreRate API — request collection (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN
@userToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN
@ownerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN
# Tip: every protected request also accepts `X-Auth-Token: {{token}}` instead of the Authorization header.

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@storerate.com", "password": "Admin@1234" }

### Login as normal user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user1@storerate.com", "password": "User@12345" }

### Login as store owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner1@storerate.com", "password": "Owner@1234" }

### Register a normal user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Brand New Platform Member Account",
  "email": "newmember@example.com",
  "address": "Kukatpally, Hyderabad",
  "password": "Member@123"
}

### Current profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Change password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "User@12345", "newPassword": "Fresh@1234" }

### ─── Admin ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Users — filter + sort + paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?address=kukatpally&role=user&sortBy=name&order=desc&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Store owners without a store (for the Add Store picker)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?unassignedOwners=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### User details (store owners include their store + rating)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a user (role: admin | user | store_owner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Second Administrator Account",
  "email": "admin2@storerate.com",
  "password": "Admin@1234",
  "address": "StoreRate HQ, Hyderabad",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Stores — sorted by rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stores?sortBy=rating&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a store for an existing owner (owner6 has no store in the seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kondapur Daily Needs Provision Store",
  "email": "hello@kondapurdaily.com",
  "address": "Kondapur Main Road, Hyderabad 500084",
  "ownerId": 7
}

### Create a store together with a new owner account
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Miyapur Home Appliances Showroom",
  "email": "sales@miyapurappliances.com",
  "address": "Miyapur X Roads, Hyderabad 500049",
  "owner": {
    "name": "Venkata Ramana Murthy Owner",
    "email": "owner7@storerate.com",
    "password": "Owner@1234",
    "address": "Miyapur, Hyderabad"
  }
}

### ─── Normal user ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Browse stores (search name OR address)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores?q=hitech&sortBy=rating&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Submit / modify my rating for store 2 (201 first time, 200 afterwards)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/stores/2/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5 }

### ─── Store owner ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### My store + average rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/owner/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Users who rated my store
GET {{baseUrl}}/owner/ratings?sortBy=rating&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
